translated_text:
CHAPTER VI
PROHIBITIONS
Article 43
(1) Every Person in Charge of business and/or activity whose business and/or activity operation may disrupt the growth and development of children is prohibited from accepting child visitors.
(2) Business and/or activity as referred to in paragraph (1) includes:
a. discotheque;
b. night club;
c. bar;
d. adult karaoke;
e. pub;
f. massage parlor;
g. steam bath/sauna parlor; and
h. other similar business fields.

